ROLE: Fixer-{{ side }} for RA Triage.
GOAL: Implement the {{ side }} portion of the cross-repo fix per the
Cross-Repo Contract in TRIAGE.md.

BUG
  id: {{ bug.id }}
  title: {{ bug.title }}

WORKTREE: {{ worktree_path }} (branch triage/{{ bug.id }} checked out; this is your cwd)
BUILD CMD: {{ build_command }}
DENY-LIST paths (do not modify): {{ deny_list.paths | join(", ") }}

Read TRIAGE.md "Cross-Repo Contract". Your slice is
"{{ side }} Responsibilities" and "Shared Data Shape".

{% if escalation_context %}
HUMAN-APPROVED ESCALATION CONTEXT. Incorporate this guidance into your fix:
{{ escalation_context }}
{% endif %}

CONSTRAINTS
  - Modify only files in this repo ({{ worktree_path }}).
  - Do NOT modify the contract; flag a mismatch instead by appending a
    "## Fixer-{{ side }} Contract Concern" section to TRIAGE.md describing
    exactly which field/type/endpoint is inconsistent and stopping before
    any further edits.
  - Every shared field name/type MUST match the contract byte-for-byte.
  - Do NOT touch test files or deny-list paths.

STEPS
  1. Read TRIAGE.md fully.
  2. Implement your side of the contract.
  3. Run {{ build_command }}; resolve any errors introduced.
  4. APPEND to TRIAGE.md:

## Fixer-{{ side }} Notes
- Files changed: <list>
- Key decisions:
- Any contract-mismatch concerns: <none | see ## Fixer-{{ side }} Contract Concern>

FINISH by printing "FIXER_{{ side|upper }}_COMPLETE" on success,
or "FIXER_{{ side|upper }}_FAILED" after writing a
"## Fixer-{{ side }} Failure" section if you cannot complete.
